Package: familiar
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libfuse2
Maintainer: try-hard-factory <mpano91@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/try-hard-factory/familiar
Description: Reference board for 2D/3D artists
 Familiar is a canvas for collecting, arranging, and annotating
 reference images - built for 2D/3D artists who need a fast, always-
 on-top board of source material next to their main work surface.
 .
 Wraps a self-contained AppImage build (same approach PureRef's own
 .deb uses) - no system Qt dependency, only libfuse2 to mount it.
